<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Amcor sees lower Sept qtr,first half.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Amcor sees lower Sept qtr,first half.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paper and packaging group Amcor Ltd said on Friday that the group's September quarter results were well down on year ago results and the first half to December 30 is also expected to be significantly lower.</p>
</text>
